@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title CP — current evidence versus target and hypothesis
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Accepted planning direction\nFragmentation / intended reuse / controlled sharing / history" as Intent
rectangle "Actual documentary/technical records\nElicitation extracts; dated host record; current source models" as Records
rectangle "Unknown current daily workflow\nActual task steps / tools / handoffs / effort not observed" as Unknown #4A302B
rectangle "Target rules and possible bottlenecks\nKeep intended response and testable hypothesis separately labeled" as Target
Intent --> Target : motivates investigation / intended value
Records --> Unknown : bounds what is and is not established
Unknown ..> Target : no conversion to an observed as-is workflow
note bottom of Target
Accepted profile policy is target behavior, not a measured current routine.
A historical server snapshot is not task research or capacity proof.
end note

legend bottom
Source-based analysis; target behavior and hypotheses are not observed current task sequences.
No interview, business-task timing, live product/reference inspection or improvement test performed.
endlegend
@enduml
